{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1415044-two-questions-immaculate-order-predate-realm-islands-south-of-blessed-isle-named","id":1415044,"title":"Two questions: Immaculate Order predate Realm? Islands south of Blessed Isle named?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-22T05:20:07-07:00","id":1415044,"title":"Two questions: Immaculate Order predate Realm? Islands south of Blessed Isle named?","content":"Two quick questions:<br /> <br /> Do we know whether the Immaculate Order predates the Realm? I seem to remember that a version of the Immaculate Order also exists in Lookshy.<br /> <br /> I notice that the Exalted map has changed in third edition, apparently erasing the Wavehold Prefecture and the Isle of Eternal Leaves. Are the three big islands to the south of the Blessed Isle named in the <b>Realm </b>book?<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-22T05:45:55-07:00","id":1415048,"title":"","content":"The Immaculate Faith predates the Realm, the Immaculate Order does not. The Immaculate Order is the Realm branch of the Faith.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://w